cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below and retain its evidence limitations."
title: "Onyx Devs Lab Enterprise AI Case-study Evidence Register"
type: dataset
version: "2026.09.09"
date-released: 2026-09-09
authors:
  - name: "ONYX DEVS LAB LIMITED"
    alias: "Onyx Devs Lab"
    website: "https://hk.onyxdevslab.com/"
    email: "info@onyxdevslab.com"
abstract: >-
  A provider-maintained, versioned register of 31 metrics from six anonymised
  enterprise AI delivery cases spanning AI advisory, custom AI development, and
  Forward Deployed Engineering. It includes measurement definitions, canonical
  source pages, and explicit evidence boundaries. The records are first-party
  project validation snapshots, not independent audits, endorsements, or universal
  performance benchmarks.
keywords:
  - "enterprise AI"
  - "AI advisory"
  - "AI consulting Hong Kong"
  - "custom AI development"
  - "Forward Deployed Engineering"
  - "FDE"
  - "AI agent"
  - "ERP integration"
  - "AI governance"
  - "AI evaluation"
  - "generative engine optimization"
